  "updated": "2026-11-17",
  "html": "<p>Vitrine turns a product name and a category into a polished product card: an AI-written <strong>title</strong>, a <strong>short description</strong> and a set of <strong>keywords</strong>, shown on a styled card you can edit and export.</p>\n<h2 id=\"create-your-first-card\">Create your first card</h2>\n<ol>\n<li>Open the <strong>Studio</strong> from the sidebar (or press <code>G</code> then <code>S</code>).</li>\n<li>Type the <strong>product name</strong>, for example &quot;Handwoven Banarasi silk saree&quot;.</li>\n<li>Pick a <strong>category</strong>. Each category has its own 3D icon.</li>\n<li>Press <strong>Generate details</strong>. In a few seconds the card appears with a title, a description and keywords.</li>\n<li>Click any text on the card to edit it, or switch templates in the toolbar.</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"do-i-need-an-account\">Do I need an account?</h2>\n<p>No. Guest mode works without signing in. Your cards are saved in this browser&#39;s local storage only. Create a free account to sync cards across devices, keep a Library in the cloud, save a Brand Kit to your account and see your profile stats. When you sign in for the first time, Vitrine offers to import the cards you made as a guest.</p>\n<h2 id=\"the-main-areas\">The main areas</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Studio</strong>: generate, edit, compare variations and export.</li>\n<li><strong>Library</strong>: every card you saved, with search and favourites.</li>\n<li><strong>Templates</strong>: six card designs, from Minimal to Marketplace listing.</li>\n<li><strong>Brand Kit</strong>: your brand voice and colours, used in every generation.</li>\n<li><strong>Settings</strong>: themes, generation defaults, export options, privacy and accessibility.</li>\n<li><strong>Ask Kabir</strong>: the support assistant in the bottom-right corner.</li>\n</ul>\n",
