  "html": "<p>Switch templates at any time: your copy stays the same, only the design changes.</p>\n<h2 id=\"the-six-templates\">The six templates</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Minimal</strong>: ivory background, generous whitespace, perfect for clean catalogues.</li>\n<li><strong>Luxe Gold</strong>: deep emerald with gold details for premium products.</li>\n<li><strong>Glass</strong>: frosted glass panels over soft light; great for tech and beauty.</li>\n<li><strong>Bold</strong>: large type and high contrast for launches and sales.</li>\n<li><strong>Instagram post</strong>: a square 1:1 layout sized for social media.</li>\n<li><strong>Marketplace listing</strong>: a clean listing with price, keyword bullets and a buy-box style layout.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"default-template\">Default template</h2>\n<p>Choose your default in Settings, Card &amp; Export. You can also browse all templates on the Templates page and press &quot;Use template&quot;.</p>\n",
