  "html": "<p>Open the <strong>Export</strong> menu in the Studio toolbar.</p>\n<h2 id=\"formats\">Formats</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>PNG</strong>: a high-resolution image of the card exactly as you see it. Choose 1x, 2x or 3x scale in Settings, Card &amp; Export.</li>\n<li><strong>JSON</strong>: the title, description, keywords, category and template as structured data, handy for developers and product feeds.</li>\n<li><strong>HTML</strong>: a self-contained, safely escaped HTML snippet with inline styles that you can paste into a store page or newsletter.</li>\n<li><strong>Copy text</strong>: copies the title, description and keywords to your clipboard.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"watermark\">Watermark</h2>\n<p>PNG exports include a small &quot;Made with Vitrine&quot; mark by default. Turn it off in Settings, Card &amp; Export.</p>\n",
