  "updated": "2026-11-17",
  "html": "<p>The Brand Kit is sent with every generation while it is switched on.</p>\n<h2 id=\"fields\">Fields</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Brand name</strong>: used naturally in copy when it fits.</li>\n<li><strong>Brand voice</strong>: a sentence or two, for example &quot;warm, modern Indian craft, never stuffy&quot;.</li>\n<li><strong>Words to avoid</strong>: words the AI should never use, separated by commas.</li>\n<li><strong>Brand colours</strong>: up to five hex colours. They tint the Luxe and Bold templates and can inspire imagery in the copy.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"switching-it-on-or-off\">Switching it on or off</h2>\n<p>Use the &quot;Use Brand Kit&quot; switch on the Brand Kit page or in Settings, Brand Kit. Guests can use a Brand Kit too; it is stored in the browser.</p>\n",
