  "updated": "2026-11-17",
  "html": "<h2 id=\"what-we-store\">What we store</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Guests</strong>: cards, settings and Brand Kit stay in your browser&#39;s local storage.</li>\n<li><strong>Account holders</strong>: your profile (name, avatar, consent record), cards, Brand Kit and settings are stored in Google Firebase (Firestore) and protected by security rules so only you can read them.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"ai-processing\">AI processing</h2>\n<p>The product details you type are sent to our AI providers (Groq, with Google Gemini as a fallback) to write the copy. Free tiers of AI services may use inputs to improve their services, so <strong>do not type personal or confidential information</strong> into product fields.</p>\n<h2 id=\"export-your-data\">Export your data</h2>\n<p>Settings, History &amp; Privacy, <strong>Export my data</strong> downloads a JSON file with your profile, settings, Brand Kit and all cards.</p>\n<h2 id=\"delete-your-account\">Delete your account</h2>\n<p>Settings, Account, <strong>Delete account</strong> permanently deletes your cards, profile and login. This cannot be undone. Guests can clear everything with <strong>Clear local data</strong>.</p>\n<h2 id=\"cookies\">Cookies</h2>\n<p>Vitrine uses only essential storage by default (sign-in session and your cookie choice). Preference storage (theme, sounds, defaults) is optional and can be changed any time from the &quot;Cookie settings&quot; link in the footer.</p>\n<h2 id=\"rights-and-contact\">Rights and contact</h2>\n<p>You can request access, correction or deletion of your data. See the Privacy Policy for details and the grievance contact.</p>\n",
