  "updated": "2026-11-17",
  "html": "<h2 id=\"ai-is-busy-or-generation-failed\">&quot;AI is busy&quot; or generation failed</h2>\n<p>Wait a few seconds and press Generate again. If you see a rate-limit message, wait for the countdown. If it keeps failing, both AI providers may be down; try again later.</p>\n<h2 id=\"google-sign-in-popup-closes-or-is-blocked\">Google sign-in popup closes or is blocked</h2>\n<p>Allow pop-ups for this site and try again. If the popup is blocked, Vitrine switches to a full-page redirect automatically.</p>\n<h2 id=\"the-verification-email-did-not-arrive\">The verification email did not arrive</h2>\n<p>Check spam and promotions folders, then use <strong>Resend email</strong> on the Verify email page (once per minute).</p>\n<h2 id=\"png-export-looks-different\">PNG export looks different</h2>\n<p>Wait until fonts and images finish loading, then export again. Very large images are scaled down for export.</p>\n<h2 id=\"offline\">Offline</h2>\n<p>Vitrine works as an installable app. Without internet you can browse the interface and your local cards, but generation and sync need a connection. An offline page appears if a page cannot load.</p>\n<h2 id=\"still-stuck\">Still stuck?</h2>\n<p>Ask Kabir, or choose <strong>Talk to a human</strong> to open a support ticket.</p>\n",
